      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "CHEEKY SLOY (1) box seated before sticking on well to finish 1.75 lengths away in second (23.28) at this track in a Mix 3/4 over 401m. Sure to be about the mark. BEEF KEBAB (8) scored a most impressive win two back then drifted back and missed the frame latest finishing a 8 length 4th at this track (18.58). Has performed well from this box with a win and two minor placings to her name from five starts. Will give the top chances plenty to think about. CORLESS ROGUE (7) showed little early speed at his last couple, the latest finishing sixth (23.48) in a Grade 5 at this track. Has a good record at this journey. Form from his last run is proving to be solid. Key runner who gets his chance to atone. BRONNY'S BLUE (4) is in the mix despite finishing out of the placings here last start.",
